# The maintainer control plane.
#
# Anyone may propose a change to a path below. Only a maintainer may approve it.
# Everything not listed here needs an ordinary review.
#
# There is deliberately no `*` catch-all. It would name an owner for every path
# in the repository and make the entries below look like they carry no more
# weight than the rest.
#
# `.github/` is owned in full, not just the workflows. A pull request runs the
# workflow files as they exist in that pull request, so a change deleting a
# check disables the very thing that would have objected to it. The same
# argument covers `scripts/`, which the workflows call.

/SPEC.md              @MarcusKainth
/PURITY.md            @MarcusKainth
/spec/                @MarcusKainth

/.github/             @MarcusKainth
/scripts/             @MarcusKainth

/LICENSE              @MarcusKainth
/LICENSING.md         @MarcusKainth
/rom/LICENSE          @MarcusKainth
/SECURITY.md          @MarcusKainth
/AI_POLICY.md         @MarcusKainth
/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md   @MarcusKainth
